## Rationalization prevention

| Excuse | Reality |
|--------|---------|
| "I'll stop after the strategy phases" | User asked for execution. Phases 11–21 are the deliverables. Keep going. |
| "Content can be a follow-up session" | Write Phase 14 pages now. Tracker enables resume, not deferral. |
| "Design system is overkill" | Phase 12 output prevents rework in 14–18. Run ui-ux-pro-max. |
| "I'll skip SEO until after launch" | Phase 16 is pre-launch SEO. Launch without it wastes Phase 14 content. |
| "Phase 19 needs client budget approval" | Skip with reason, continue to 20. Do not halt the runbook. |
